{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11309090","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11309090","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1130909001:1":{"text":"ああ、大丈夫だ。多少バードマウントに蹴られたけど、大した怪我はない。","source_cn":"我们啊，还好。被陆行鸟踢了几脚，没受大伤。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88A67DFF3D8FE003","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130909002:1":{"text":"裏に何かあるはずだ。疫病か、異変か。あるいは未知の災害かもしれない。こんな中で金儲けができるのか……","source_cn":"这背后一定有什么原因。瘟疫？疾病？或者其他未知的灾难。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70856D5DAAB5A1C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130909003:1":{"text":"確かに用心することに越したことはないな。","source_cn":"说是这么说，但我们还是小心点比较好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F367CB4A560F430","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1130909004:0":{"text":"だが、俺はこんなことで臆病になる男じゃないぞ！","source_cn":"我可不是畏手畏脚的人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D73FF139A9CFC9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:行商德博拉":{"text":"行商人のデボラ","source":"行商德博拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:行商乔瑟夫":{"text":"行商人のジョーセフ","source":"行商乔瑟夫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}